1Ki 12:1 , The Israelites, assembled at Shechem to crown Rehoboam, by Jeroboam make a suit of relaxation unto him;
1Ki 12:6 , Rehoboam, refusing the old men's counsel, answers them roughly;
1Ki 12:16 , Ten tribes revolting, kill Adoram, and make Rehoboam flee;
1Ki 12:21 , Rehoboam, raising an army, is forbidden by Shemaiah;
1Ki 12:25 , Jeroboam strengthens himself by cities;
1Ki 12:26 , and by the idolatry of the two calves.
